# Mini Banking System in C

## Project Description
Mini Banking System is a simple console-based application developed using the C programming language.

It simulates basic banking operations through a menu-driven interface.

## Features
- Check Account Balance
- Deposit Money
- Withdraw Money
- Exit the Program

## Programming Concepts Used
- Variables and Data Types
- printf() and scanf()
- do-while Loop
- switch-case
- if-else Statements
- Arithmetic Operators

## Initial Balance
The program starts with an initial balance of Rs. 1000.

